{"id": "34451", "title": "爱宝娘子", "author": "橙星", "category": "文学名著", "count": 42, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34451.htm", "intro": "生平无大志，唯有寻宝高的艾宝拿到一张藏宝图，她不惜抛家、弃父母出外去寻宝，怎知碰上超级带塞的云啸魂大侠！多亏他的塞，她到湖里寻宝却被他误以为投湖自杀，硬被救起来，跟她心爱的挖宝助手──一只老鼠──从此失散、生死两茫茫！多亏他的塞，她的藏宝图差点被抢，就此步上被狼嚎、被变态追的逃亡之旅！ \r\n　　好不容易云大侠终于良心发现，说愿意带她到宝藏藏匿地点，可是怎么怪怪的呢？？藏宝地点就在他家旁，而且东挖挖西挖挖也找不到宝藏？！艾宝并不知道，所谓的藏宝都是某位大嫂要恶整她小叔云大侠的计谋，而云大侠千方百计只想让他的爱宝娘子知道，他才是她这辈子最大的宝藏……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34451", "chapters": [{"title": "楔子", "file": "2186681.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2186682.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2186683.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2186684.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2186685.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2186686.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2186687.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2186688.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2186689.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2186690.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2186691.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2186692.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2186693.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2186694.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2186695.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2186696.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2186697.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2186698.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2186699.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2186700.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2186701.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2186702.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2186703.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2186704.html", "ava